# --- THIS REPO'S BIG FILES: the 5 archives, ~146 MB total. Never commit them.
# manifest.json stays tracked: it holds the urls + sha256 and is the repo's
# only source of truth. Binaries are reproduced with "npm run fetch".
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.part
